%% POST-MVP REFERENCE - not part of the active Webinar-first MVP.
sequenceDiagram
    title Post-MVP reference: individual voucher and payment conversion
    participant SP as Salesperson
    participant CRM as CRM
    participant U as Individual
    participant PLAT as Platform
    participant BILL as Billing

    SP->>CRM: Select eligible attendee
    CRM->>CRM: Issue voucher
    CRM-->>U: Send redeem link
    U->>PLAT: Enter voucher
    PLAT->>BILL: Create order/payment
    BILL-->>PLAT: Payment status
    PLAT-->>CRM: Conversion result
